      "difficulty": "Averge",
      "prompt_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{array}{l} \\text {设} \\xi \\sim N(0,1), \\text {已知} \\xi \\text {的分布函数为} P\\{\\zeta \\leq x\\} = F(x)(0 \\leq x &lt; +\\infty) \\text {且} 0 &lt; a &lt; b, \\text {用分布函数} F(x) \\text {之值表示概率} \\\\ P\\{-b &lt; \\zeta \\leq -a\\} = (\\ )\\ . \\end{array}\">\\begin{array}{l} \\text {设} \\xi \\sim N(0,1), \\text {已知} \\xi \\text {的分布函数为} P\\{\\zeta \\leq x\\} = F(x)(0 \\leq x &lt; +\\infty) \\text {且} 0 &lt; a &lt; b, \\text {用分布函数} F(x) \\text {之值表示概率} \\\\ P\\{-b &lt; \\zeta \\leq -a\\} = (\\ )\\ . \\end{array}</div>",
