      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{标准正态分布在某区间内的概率计算式为}\\\\&amp;P\\{a&lt;X&lt;b\\}=P\\{a\\leq X\\leq b\\}=P\\{a\\leq X&lt;b\\}=P\\{a&lt;X\\leq b\\}=\\Phi(b)-\\Phi(a).\\\\&amp;\\text{故}P\\{-2.12&lt;\\xi&lt;1.16\\}=\\Phi(1.16)-\\Phi(-2.12),\\\\&amp;\\text{又}\\quad\\Phi(-2.12)=1-\\Phi(2.12),\\\\&amp;\\text{所以}P\\{-2.12&lt;\\xi&lt;1.16\\}=\\Phi(1.16)-\\Phi(-2.12)=\\Phi(1.16)+\\Phi(2.12)-1=0.860\\,.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{标准正态分布在某区间内的概率计算式为}\\\\&amp;P\\{a&lt;X&lt;b\\}=P\\{a\\leq X\\leq b\\}=P\\{a\\leq X&lt;b\\}=P\\{a&lt;X\\leq b\\}=\\Phi(b)-\\Phi(a).\\\\&amp;\\text{故}P\\{-2.12&lt;\\xi&lt;1.16\\}=\\Phi(1.16)-\\Phi(-2.12),\\\\&amp;\\text{又}\\quad\\Phi(-2.12)=1-\\Phi(2.12),\\\\&amp;\\text{所以}P\\{-2.12&lt;\\xi&lt;1.16\\}=\\Phi(1.16)-\\Phi(-2.12)=\\Phi(1.16)+\\Phi(2.12)-1=0.860\\,.\\end{aligned}</div>"
